{"id":843339,"title":"01｜数字人的定义","content":"课程介绍基于AIGC的数字人制作与企业应用，分为四个部分。前两章探讨数字人的基础概念及其火爆原因；后两章通过实操演示如何制作和应用数字人于企业和个人业务中。目标是让学习者掌握数字人制作方法，并能将其应用于实际场景。第一章为数字人入门基础，定义了数字人为结合计算机图形学、渲染技术、动作捕捉及深度学习等手段创造的非物理世界人物。目前业界对数字人没有统一标准，但大致分为超级自然虚拟人（AI being）和广义数字人（Mentahuman）。本课程聚焦于前者，因其技术门槛较低且易于普通人操作。超级自然虚拟人利用AI技术实现创建、驱动及内容生成，具备感知与表达能力，可用于交互或视频生成。而广义数字人则依赖CG建模或手绘等方式配合动捕技术来实现。以《阿凡达》为例，展示了广义数字人在电影中的应用，通过CG建模与面部捕捉技术使角色生动呈现。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397521,"user_name":"🌿","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2066322,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"5F819BBD11054E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/87/92/9ac4c335.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738828015,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144245,"content":"添加作者微信申请账号：sdzhx414","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4073753,"ctime":1738893821,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397521,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100856601,"comment_content":"老师，能否提供一个账号实操下","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4073753,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3e/29/19/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"张宏祥","note":"","ucode":"66EC38BF261952","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656818,"discussion_content":"添加作者微信申请账号：sdzhx414","content_length":19,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1738893821,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":398144,"user_name":"Geek_12bb3c","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4087687,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"A9B67DFF5717B5","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1740582119,"is_pvip":f